History Tracers — How to Navigate (English)

Welcome to History Tracers! Let me show you how to get started.

When you open the site, the main content appears in the center. On the left, you'll find the sidebar menu — your gateway to everything.

On wide screens, the sidebar sits visible. On mobile, tap the three-line button at the top-left to open it. Tap again or tap outside to close.

Click any menu title to expand its options. Click an option to open that page. The content loads in the main area while the sidebar stays available.

Use your browser's back and forward buttons to move between pages. Some content has chapters — use the navigation bar at the bottom to move through them.

That's it! You're ready to explore.

Come play. Come learn. History Tracers — free and open source.